stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> LandingPage: Visitor opens the Curis platform website

    state LandingPage {
        [*] --> HeroSection
        HeroSection --> CTA_HeroButton: Click "Get Started"

        note right of HeroSection
            - Headline: Communicates Curis' value to doctors
            - Subheading: Highlights top benefits (e.g., simplified workflows, secure access)
            - Background image/video: Shows doctor using Curis
            - CTA Button: "Get Started"
        end note

        [*] --> FeaturesOverview

        note right of FeaturesOverview
            - Grid layout or carousel format
            - Icon + short description for each feature
            - Examples: 
              • Secure Patient Records
              • Easy Appointment Management
              • e-Prescription Tools
        end note

        [*] --> TestimonialsSection

        note right of TestimonialsSection
            - Shows doctor reviews or endorsements
            - Includes photos or names (real or placeholder)
            - Optionally includes star ratings or video clips
        end note

        [*] --> ProductDemoSection

        note right of ProductDemoSection
            - 1-minute explainer video or animated preview
            - Carousel of screenshots (e.g., appointments screen, notes view)
            - "See How It Works" CTA
        end note

        [*] --> BenefitsSection

        note right of BenefitsSection
            - Bulleted advantages: 
              • Save Time
              • Streamline Doctor Tasks
              • Enhance Patient Satisfaction
            - Visuals/icons for quick scanning
        end note

        [*] --> TrustIndicatorsSection

        note right of TrustIndicatorsSection
            - Display logos of certified medical boards
            - Mention data protection compliance (e.g., HIPAA, GDPR)
            - Optional: "As Featured In" media logos or partners
        end note

        [*] --> ContactSection

        note right of ContactSection
            - "Contact Us" form (Name, Email, Message)
            - Email link, phone (optional), support chat link
            - Social media icons (LinkedIn, Twitter, etc.)
        end note

        [*] --> FooterSection

        note right of FooterSection
            - Links: About, FAQs, Privacy Policy, Terms of Service
            - Copyright text
            - Social media icons
        end note

        %% CTAs are spread across the page
        LandingPage --> CTA_HeroButton: CTA (Hero)
        LandingPage --> CTA_FeaturesButton: CTA (Features Overview)
        LandingPage --> CTA_DemoButton: CTA (Product Demo)
        LandingPage --> CTA_BenefitsButton: CTA (Benefits Section)
    }

    %% Optionally navigate to Login
    CTA_HeroButton --> LoginPage: Redirect to login on click
    CTA_FeaturesButton --> LoginPage: Redirect to login
    CTA_DemoButton --> LoginPage: Redirect to login
    CTA_BenefitsButton --> LoginPage: Redirect to login

    LandingPage --> [*]: User exits site
